    "html": "<p>The intensity pattern of monochromatic light of wavelength λ, is projected onto a screen.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What combination produces this pattern?</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td></td><td><p>Number of slits</p></td><td><p>Width of slits<br/></p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"A\"><td><p>A.</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>smaller than λ</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"B\"><td><p>B.</p></td><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>greater than λ</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"C\"><td><p>C.</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>smaller than λ</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"D\"><td><p>D.</p></td><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>greater than λ</p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>[1]</p>"
